  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "4.0.0 — V1 transactions by default. Breaking change: HTTP transaction/block reads and WebSocket block subscriptions now advertise transaction version 1; full configuration objects also default MaxSupportedTransactionVersion to 1. Use explicit version 0 to retain legacy/v0-only reads, or null in full options to omit the version field. Base58/binary encodings require an explicit version 0 or null; use base64, JSON, or jsonParsed for V1. Adds GetTransactionOptions.MinContextSlot and GetSignatureStatusesWithOptionsAsync with history, commitment, and minimum-context-slot options. Updates NuGet dependencies and the pinned .NET 10 toolchain, fixes the SourceLink security-audit failure, and synchronizes solution, benchmark, and packed AOT locks. Verified with default V1 HTTP/WebSocket tests, a read-only mainnet V1 regression, and packed Native AOT smoke checks. Full details: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/v4.0.0/CHANGELOG.md",
